[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l012","ordinal":177409,"en":"A people no man would wish to see."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l013","ordinal":177410,"en":"Beijing is no easy place;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l014","ordinal":177411,"en":"Your father Manas would not listen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l015","ordinal":177412,"en":"And led the armies of the world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l016","ordinal":177413,"en":"Leaving the village of sixty sons"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l017","ordinal":177414,"en":"And widowed women desolate!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l018","ordinal":177415,"en":"Your wretched mother speaks—know this;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l019","ordinal":177416,"en":"Oh, my only son, heed my words!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l020","ordinal":177417,"en":"In teeming China,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l021","ordinal":177418,"en":"There are the peoples of forty tribes;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l022","ordinal":177419,"en":"Whoever attacks it, that Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l023","ordinal":177420,"en":"By custom drinks their blood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l024","ordinal":177421,"en":"Beijing is no easy place;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l025","ordinal":177422,"en":"The Chinese are no people to toy with!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l026","ordinal":177423,"en":"Mighty China is a powerful nation;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l027","ordinal":177424,"en":"My dear son, know this:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l028","ordinal":177425,"en":"When you see their multitude, they are black beetles!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l029","ordinal":177426,"en":"If you wage holy war against the unbelievers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l030","ordinal":177427,"en":"My darling foal,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l031","ordinal":177428,"en":"Hero Khan Kongurbai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l032","ordinal":177429,"en":"Has a fortress beside the road;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l033","ordinal":177430,"en":"The Kalcha whose road is barred"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l034","ordinal":177431,"en":"Has a lion who will answer you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l035","ordinal":177432,"en":"Do not dig my grave,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l036","ordinal":177433,"en":"Forever refusing to listen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l037","ordinal":177434,"en":"Do not make my sorrows boil."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l038","ordinal":177435,"en":"Forever refusing to heed"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1325:b004:l039","ordinal":177436,"en":"Your fathers and forefathers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l001","ordinal":177437,"en":"Do not show me such a spectacle!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l002","ordinal":177438,"en":"My tiger son, hear my words!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l003","ordinal":177439,"en":"Take able Bakai, who knows the road;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l004","ordinal":177440,"en":"Take the stout-lunged, roaring,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l005","ordinal":177441,"en":"The mighty who do not retreat from death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l006","ordinal":177442,"en":"Who spare themselves nothing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l007","ordinal":177443,"en":"Gather seven sacred banners,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l008","ordinal":177444,"en":"Gather an army that makes the earth sag,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l009","ordinal":177445,"en":"Then go to Beijing!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l010","ordinal":177446,"en":"Take an army from the Muslims,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l011","ordinal":177447,"en":"Take no small force, but many,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l012","ordinal":177448,"en":"Then go to Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l013","ordinal":177449,"en":"Fools merely say “Beijing”;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l014","ordinal":177450,"en":"Those who know call it “Great Beijing”—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l015","ordinal":177451,"en":"Beijing is no small place but vast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l016","ordinal":177452,"en":"On its front side is Bakburchun,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l017","ordinal":177453,"en":"The mightiest of all is Kakan-Chin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l018","ordinal":177454,"en":"Most numerous is Shang-Kai, the great Manchu;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l019","ordinal":177455,"en":"Consider how many cities there are."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l020","ordinal":177456,"en":"If you ponder, that Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l021","ordinal":177457,"en":"Also has the aspect of a holy place."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l022","ordinal":177458,"en":"Against great, afflicted Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l023","ordinal":177459,"en":"Only then begin your conflict!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l024","ordinal":177460,"en":"I do not approve of this departure;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l025","ordinal":177461,"en":"Guard your own life yourself!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l026","ordinal":177462,"en":"My soul mate, heed me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l027","ordinal":177463,"en":"Take the whole Muslim army!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l028","ordinal":177464,"en":"Raising the Muslim battle cry,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l029","ordinal":177465,"en":"Send the army against this China!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l030","ordinal":177466,"en":"Gathering a great dark host,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l031","ordinal":177467,"en":"If you set out for Kakan-Chin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l032","ordinal":177468,"en":"Who will be left with this regret?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l033","ordinal":177469,"en":"Turn back, enter, and wage enmity,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l034","ordinal":177470,"en":"Then bring great conflict upon Kakan!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l035","ordinal":177471,"en":"Saying, “I shall gird my waist firmly,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l036","ordinal":177472,"en":"You have grown impassioned,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l037","ordinal":177473,"en":"Saying, “From the Kalcha in Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l038","ordinal":177474,"en":"I shall exact my father's blood-price.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b003:l039","ordinal":177475,"en":"Such is the nature of the journey;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l001","ordinal":177476,"en":"Understand my words without making me lament!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l002","ordinal":177477,"en":"May your journey be in the cool autumn;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l003","ordinal":177478,"en":"May your enemy Kongurbai, whom you will spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l004","ordinal":177479,"en":"Stand on a plain as small as a palm."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l005","ordinal":177480,"en":"Of the giant you have longed for,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l006","ordinal":177481,"en":"If I tell his qualities, let them be countless;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l007","ordinal":177482,"en":"When you enter battle lamenting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l008","ordinal":177483,"en":"May the spirit of your lion father,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l009","ordinal":177484,"en":"Your bloodthirsty hero, stand beside you!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l010","ordinal":177485,"en":"Your father's sworn friend Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l011","ordinal":177486,"en":"Akbaltai's Chubak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l012","ordinal":177487,"en":"Syrgak, born a lion—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l013","ordinal":177488,"en":"In the midst of that battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l014","ordinal":177489,"en":"May those soul-companions be your aid!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l015","ordinal":177490,"en":"When you advance and extend your spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l016","ordinal":177491,"en":"May all the heroes be present!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l017","ordinal":177492,"en":"I am your mother Kanykei;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l018","ordinal":177493,"en":"Receive the counsel of this unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l019","ordinal":177494,"en":"Take the Muslim army!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l020","ordinal":177495,"en":"Against the seething unbelievers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l021","ordinal":177496,"en":"Against hero Khan Kongurbai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l022","ordinal":177497,"en":"Advance thus and begin the conflict!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l023","ordinal":177498,"en":"If you gather them, you have many troops;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l024","ordinal":177499,"en":"Against the seething unbelievers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l025","ordinal":177500,"en":"You have fine men who can clash."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l026","ordinal":177501,"en":"Let me tell of the hero"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l027","ordinal":177502,"en":"Who dwells yonder in Sary-Arka;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l028","ordinal":177503,"en":"No man has defeated him in combat either."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l029","ordinal":177504,"en":"If you ask his father and lineage:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l030","ordinal":177505,"en":"His lattice walls and roof poles are of wood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l031","ordinal":177506,"en":"His first ancestor was Alach;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l032","ordinal":177507,"en":"Hero Kökchö, son of Aidarkan—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l033","ordinal":177508,"en":"The heel of the blue boot,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l034","ordinal":177509,"en":"Kökchö of the Kazakhs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l035","ordinal":177510,"en":"Broth rich with meat, fatty flesh,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1326:b004:l036","ordinal":177511,"en":"His warriors are set apart,"},{"id":"se