h"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l020","ordinal":177534,"en":"Be ashamed of yourself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l021","ordinal":177535,"en":"The bottom is related,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l022","ordinal":177536,"en":"Born with you"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l023","ordinal":177537,"en":"If not the best"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l024","ordinal":177538,"en":"His father will chase Kokçe's revenge!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l025","ordinal":177539,"en":"And my baby, and there is,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l026","ordinal":177540,"en":"Let me tell the general public:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l027","ordinal":177541,"en":"Beyond Bukarai-Sharip,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l028","ordinal":177542,"en":"The damaged Chambyl river side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l029","ordinal":177543,"en":"A handful of men's equipment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l030","ordinal":177544,"en":"Muzburchak, son of Khan Buudayyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l031","ordinal":177545,"en":"It's a strange story,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l032","ordinal":177546,"en":"It is from the Kyiva people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l033","ordinal":177547,"en":"Buyanbek, son of Muzburchak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l034","ordinal":177548,"en":"Almost out of his mind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l035","ordinal":177549,"en":"He is younger than his father."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l036","ordinal":177550,"en":"Burulkan, who received ice cream"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l037","ordinal":177551,"en":"Be ashamed with me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l038","ordinal":177552,"en":"Buyanbek, son of Muzburchak"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b003:l039","ordinal":177553,"en":"Sleep with you"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b004:l001","ordinal":177554,"en":"The stomach could be separated."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1327:b004:l002","ordinal":177555,"en":"Those kiwa peoples"},{"id":"semete